sandbox/_build/
sandbox/cover/
sandbox/deps/
sandbox/doc/
# The package builds and fetches on its own when it is the top-level project —
# `cd packages/eh_os_contract && mix test` is the proof that the seam is real, and it
# produces a build tree of its own. Root-anchored patterns do not reach it.
packages/*/_build/
packages/*/cover/
packages/*/deps/
/.fetch
erl_crash.dump
*.ez
*.beam
sandbox/config/*.secret.exs
.elixir_ls/
